  <section>
    <h2>Your server, your responsibility</h2>
    <p>You run BoxBox on hardware you control, so you decide who can reach it and what it can see. In particular:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Keep backups of anything you cannot afford to lose. BoxBox moves, renames and deletes real files.</li>
      <li>Choose strong passwords and keep the server up to date.</li>
      <li>Anyone with a share link can open what it points to until the link expires or you remove it.</li>
    </ul>
